From 9d6164fc51f08eeb535252a5eed6d7eb95876226 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:48:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Input: goodix - don't warn when the config firmware is
 missing

The controller config from /lib/firmware is optional (the controller
works with its built-in config), but the firmware core prints

  Goodix-TS 3-0014: Direct firmware load for goodix_1158_cfg.bin
  failed with error -2

on every boot when the file is not there. Request the config with
firmware_request_nowait_nowarn() to keep the boot log clean.

Signed-off-by: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/goodix.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/goodix.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/goodix.c
index 03efc0c792c2..538d139e48f8 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/goodix.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/goodix.c
@@ -1397,9 +1397,10 @@ static int goodix_ts_probe(struct i2c_client *client)
 			snprintf(ts->cfg_name, sizeof(ts->cfg_name),
 				 "goodix_%s_cfg.bin", ts->id);
 
-		error = request_firmware_nowait(THIS_MODULE, true, ts->cfg_name,
-						&client->dev, GFP_KERNEL, ts,
-						goodix_config_cb);
+		error = firmware_request_nowait_nowarn(THIS_MODULE,
+						       ts->cfg_name,
+						       &client->dev, GFP_KERNEL,
+						       ts, goodix_config_cb);
 		if (error) {
 			dev_err(&client->dev,
 				"Failed to invoke firmware loader: %d\n",
-- 
2.43.0

